ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 35246, Feb. 7, 2025>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on February 21, 2025.
Article 2 (Transitional measures regarding registration of establishment of regional headquarters)
Notwithstanding Article 2 (2), the name and location of regional headquarters, etc. established at the location of its main office and the date of its establishment shall be registered within 3 weeks after this Decree enters into force with regard to the registration of regional headquarters, etc. established before this Decree enters into force.
Article 3 Omitted.
